        "Description": "Don Yates may have a seven figure price on his head, but the missus, Valentina, is not without her own foes, one of whom has tasked you with eliminating her. Trouble is, Mrs. Yates has several friends who are liable to squeal when she turns up dead. You have only one option: silence them all.\r\rYour client is picky, however, and there are more conditions than usual. To simplify it: don&apos;t be seen, don&apos;t be sloppy, and above all else, don&apos;t get caught.\r\rOh, and don&apos;t forget your trusty garden fork!",
